{"suttaId":"sn14.18","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[769,774],"vripara":"102"},"segments":{"sn14.18:0.3":"Assaddhamūlakasuttaṃ","sn14.18:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … pe …","sn14.18:1.2":"“dhātusova, bhikkhave, sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.18:1.3":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:1.4":"ahirikā ahirikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:1.5":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:1.6":"saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:1.7":"hirimanā hirimanehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:1.8":"paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.18:1.9":"Atītampi kho, bhikkhave, addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu … pe …","sn14.18:1.10":"anāgatampi kho, bhikkhave, addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandissanti samessanti … pe ….","sn14.18:2.1":"“Etarahipi kho, bhikkhave, paccuppannaṃ addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.18:2.2":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:2.3":"ahirikā ahirikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti, duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:2.4":"saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:2.5":"hirimanā hirimanehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:2.6":"paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samentīti.(1)","sn14.18:3.1":"“Dhātusova, bhikkhave, sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.18:3.2":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:3.3":"anottappino anottappīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:3.4":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:3.5":"saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:3.6":"ottappino ottappīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:3.7":"paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti … pe …","sn14.18:3.8":"paṭhamavāro viya vitthāretabbo.(2)","sn14.18:4.1":"“Dhātusova, bhikkhave … pe …","sn14.18:4.2":"assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:4.3":"appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:4.4":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:4.5":"saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; bahussutā bahussutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti, paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti … pe ….(3)","sn14.18:5.1":"“Dhātusova, bhikkhave … pe …","sn14.18:5.2":"assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:5.3":"kusītā kusītehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:5.4":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:5.5":"saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:5.6":"āraddhavīriyā āraddhavīriyehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti … pe ….(4)","sn14.18:6.1":"“Dhātusova, bhikkhave … pe …","sn14.18:6.2":"assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:6.3":"muṭṭhassatino muṭṭhassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:6.4":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:6.5":"saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.18:6.6":"upaṭṭhitassatino upaṭṭhitassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti; paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samentīti … pe ….","sn14.18:6.7":"Aṭṭhamaṃ.(5)"},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0302a.att","from":556,"to":559,"paras":[{"para":556,"vripara":"102-106","refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["102-106. Aṭṭhamādīni teyeva assaddhādidhamme tikavasena katvā desitāni.","Tattha aṭṭhame assaddhādimūlakā kaṇhapakkhasukkapakkhavasena pañca tikā vuttā, navame ahirikamūlakā cattāro.","Dasame anottappamūlakā tayo, ekādasame appassutamūlakā dve, dvādasame kusītamūlako eko tiko vuttoti sabbepi pañcasu suttantesu pannarasa tikā honti.","Pannarasa cete suttantātipi vadanti.","Ayaṃ tikapeyyālo nāma.","Aṭṭhamādīni."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":557,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["Dutiyo vaggo."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":558,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["Kammapathavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":559,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["1-2. Asamāhitasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":555,"vripara":null,"title":"Assaddhamūlakasuttādivaṇṇanā","lines":["8-12. Assaddhamūlakasuttādivaṇṇanā"]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0302t.tik","from":560,"to":564,"paras":[{"para":560,"vripara":"102-106","refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["102-106. <b>Aṭṭhamādīnī</b>ti aṭṭhamaṃ navamaṃ dasamaṃ ekādasamaṃ dvādasamanti imāni pañca suttānīti eke.","Apare pana nava suttānīti icchanti.","Svāyamattho aṭṭhakathāyaṃ vuttoyeva.","Pāḷiyañca kesuci potthakesu likhīyati."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"],["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":561,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["Assaddhamūlakasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":562,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["Dutiyavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":563,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["Kammapathavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]},{"para":564,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn14.18:1"],"lines":["1-2. Asamāhitasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn14.18:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":559,"vripara":null,"title":"Assaddhamūlakasuttādivaṇṇanā","lines":["8-12. Assaddhamūlakasuttādivaṇṇanā"]}]},"tika2":null}
